```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Website Footer Example</title>
 <style>
 body {
 font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
 margin: 0;
 padding: 0;
 }
 .footer {
 background-color: #333;
 color: #fff;
 padding: 20px 0;
 text-align: center;
 }
